# Codex state that must never reach a repo. Only secrets and per-machine state
# are listed, so a project can still track its .codex/config.toml and skills;
# this repo tracks only .codex/AGENTS.md. Shell snapshots hold exported
# environment variables, and the SQLite files hold threads and logs.
**/.codex/auth.json
**/.codex/.credentials.json
**/.codex/history.jsonl
**/.codex/session_index.jsonl
**/.codex/sessions/
**/.codex/archived_sessions/
**/.codex/log/
**/.codex/shell_snapshots/
**/.codex/*.sqlite*

# Cloudflare Tunnel login cert (cert.pem) and tunnel credential JSON. Both are
# per-machine secrets that `cloudflared tunnel login` and `tunnel create` write.
**/.cloudflared/
